om/v/t64.5771-25/491821799_1191477622448986_335158506262625688_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eCFtYH6GQzUQ7kNvwGlV50M&_nc_oc=AdolzOxwp4scLkNItd9D_1FEc3-M1-ZvzQKozYDdixBijZHhLqSkzHaRd0Bk0TOIVYk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTVqwT-n0M_9DQnpW8jTIRR2SFy20bghoEspiyM4ykXjA&oe=6B0B3FB7"}, {"file_name": "screenshot.png", "id": "1014885264124822", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819375_1014885267458155_4732627606674535666_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8X64KDePNIYQ7kNvwHDe-JK&_nc_oc=AdrslHOa8GpjefqGK7FR6-MHTGL8cPbJjCWKUkOqXHI3u38kgliHijsDDMTh3ObH5ug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSa674W5QVZSuwvrio6Nu_0zs5RYCXMouUHS4WVsv9e3w&oe=6B0B2965"}, {"file_name": "screenshot2.png", "id": "592606743148111", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391923_592606746481444_8966562253819213417_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Aewn4WdPcHkQ7kNvwFKdgUK&_nc_oc=Adr-ZAr42VX6VvTX4nQjqoiqrUZsvp7cHrgSZ4LeQ1pL1y5PikRA4dbMtCW1sNGMWqc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSv_iG3R8cQeg8B6OEAMCcqyLW73XJkc7bDvO6C0HubuQ&oe=6B0B3495"}, {"file_name": "screenshot4.png", "id": "3508709025927990", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391985_3508709029261323_3016583868344724243_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-fEYlAMATggQ7kNvwEFo_u4&_nc_oc=AdpFSNHzqa0g_lqKHlrW9BLEMRVjj83QQQ6NBKFX3axHXv0_u18r4ZxZ9Yagw1c-FkQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRK8q1VyIJwGPdoanXKoadabY3ZDRo2TWltJYPjSHDkIA&oe=6B0B3EA7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1333140684643275", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391976_1333140687976608_7978945902575114739_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=04PDiHfHmA0Q7kNvwGAWjum&_nc_oc=AdpRpc4KGkdMz9B95n1z6hfKmd7640Iee_mz2H8uNvqYUpILorAXSxGgDNTAwqBTkkQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTGHW95YmHtzAbuO3rtjSSUJbI3ospgbXIpenuYMTygMQ&oe=6B0B4310"}, "display_name": "Fit Beat Combat : Free Style Boxing", "keywords": ["Fitness", "Boxing"], "long_description": "# Catch the Rhythm, Punch Your Way to Fit in VR!\n\nTired of boring workouts? Ready to **truly enjoy** getting fit? Welcome to **Fit Beat Combat Boxing**! Experience an exhilarating **VR fitness game** on Meta Quest where rhythm meets power! This isn't just another game \u2013 it's your personal boxing ring, high-energy dance floor, and path to a healthier, stronger you. An addictive **VR workout** challenge!\n\n# Feel the Beat, Land the Punch!\n\nDynamic VR arenas meet heart-pumping music. Simple controls: put on your Quest headset (2, 3, or Pro) & move! Notes sync to infectious beats. Unleash your inner champion! **Jab, cross, hook, and uppercut** notes with precision. **Duck and weave** past obstacles, keeping your body moving and heart rate soaring. Intuitive, exhilarating, fun **full-body workout** to make you sweat! Perfect for cardio and calorie burning!\n\n# Your Personal Coach Awaits!\n\nYou're not alone. Our expert **virtual instructor** guides form, pushes you, & cheers you on. Learn technique and feel the burn. Adapts for **beginners** to **fitness pros** to keep you motivated.\n\n# Workout Your Way!\n\nDitch boring apps & gyms! **Fit Beat Combat Boxing** is your fun, effective fitness routine. Smash beats to reach goals like **weight loss**, boosting **stamina**, improving **coordination**, or **stress relief**!\n\n# Key Features:\n\n- **Rhythm Boxing Gameplay:** Punch, duck, dodge to music! Music & exercise.\n- **Full-Body Workout:** Arms, core, legs workout for max calorie burn.\n- **Engaging Soundtrack:** Energizing music keeps you moving.\n\n\n", "short_desc